      "imagePath": "images/02.jpg",
      "text": "Bathtime is Jack's\nfavourite part of\nthe day.\n'I'll be back in a\nfew moments,'\nsays his mom."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "imagePath": "images/03.jpg",
      "text": "'Make sure to clean\nbehind your ears.'"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "imagePath": "images/04.jpg",
      "text": "There's a SWOOSH.\nAnd a swish of a tail."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
